### Category List
GET {{dotnet_ecommerce_api_HostAddress}}/v1/api/categories

### Caregory Create
POST {{dotnet_ecommerce_api_HostAddress}}/v1/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name" : "Electric",
    "description": "This is a new Elctronic device for everyone"
}

